title: congreso single-party majority

You should not be here??! Report a bug if you see this 🙏🙏

please please do so via <a class="link" target="_blank" href="https://github.com/broken-arrows/route_to_itaca/issues">GitHub Issues</a>

you're allowed to make a wish once you do so! ✨

- @post_event.make_a_wish

@party
title: [? if congreso_coalition_majority_party == "cs": csspa ?][? if congreso_coalition_majority_party != "cs": [+ congreso_coalition_majority_party +]?] <span class="gobierno-coalition" data-parties="[+ congreso_coalition_majority_party +]" data-summary="Majority government - [+ congreso_coalition_majority_s +]/[+ congreso_s_majority +]">Majority Government</span>
subtitle: With these results, what other option is even there?
view-if: congreso_coalition_majority_s > 0
choose-if: congreso_coalition_majority_reach
unavailable-subtitle: No single party reached an absolute majority on its own.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.spanish_pm = Q[Q.congreso_coalition_majority_party + "_leader"];
    Q.spanish_pm_gender = Q[Q.congreso_coalition_majority_party + "_gender"];
    Q.spanish_pm_party = Q.congreso_coalition_majority_party;
    Q.spanish_coalition = [Q.congreso_coalition_majority_party];
    var display_party = Q.congreso_coalition_majority_party == "cs" ? "csspa" : Q.congreso_coalition_majority_party;
    G.setText(Q, "spanish_coalition_disp", G.text("{display_party} {government}", {
        display_party: String(display_party),
        government: G.governmentTooltipText("gobierno", Q.spanish_coalition, G.text("Majority government - {seats}/{majority}", {
            seats: String(Q.congreso_coalition_majority_s),
            majority: String(Q.congreso_s_majority)
        }), G.text("<span style=\"color: var(--{congreso_coalition_majority_party}); font-style: italic;\">Majority Government</span>", {
            congreso_coalition_majority_party: String(Q.congreso_coalition_majority_party)
        }))
    }));
!}

**A new government is formed!**

The recently appointed [+ spanish_coalition_disp +] Gobierno will be lead by [? if spanish_pm_gender == "m": Presidente ?][? if spanish_pm_gender == "f": Presidenta ?][+ spanish_pm +].

-@post_event: We'll see eachother in 4 years I guess...
